    "code": " MOD = 998244353\n\nn, m, k = input().split()\n\n\n\nn = int(n)\n\nm = int(m)\n\nk = int(k)\n\n\n\n# Taken from https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/binomial-coefficient-dp-9/\n\ndef nCr(n , k):\n\n    C = [0 for i in range(k+1)]\n\n    C[0] = 1\n\n\n\n    for i in range(1,n+1):\n\n        j = min(i ,k)\n\n        while (j>0):\n\n            C[j] = C[j] + C[j-1]\n\n            j -= 1\n\n    return C[k]\n\n\n\nanswer = m * nCr(n-1, k) * (m-1)**k\n\nprint(answer%MOD)\n",
